[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The same page is served locally and published as an artifact, from one template

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-VIEW-SERVES-LOCALLY-AND-AS-AN-ARTIFACT
TITLE: The same page is served locally and published as an artifact, from one template
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The task writes a full standalone page that opens from disk and from a loopback server, and an artifact copy that is the same bytes inside the host's wrapper. Both come from one template; the only difference is the wrapper. The artifact is a copy the session publishes, never a different render, and v1's page at its original link is never republished.
<<<
